[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9362.83, "timestamp": "02:36:02", "text": "開封時の音楽を聴いてください。わかった。それで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9366.91, "timestamp": "02:36:06", "text": "前回の開封配信では"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9371.349, "timestamp": "02:36:11", "text": "浴室の用事を済ませた。この場所。それで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9374.309, "timestamp": "02:36:14", "text": "我々は1位、1位を獲得した"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9379.469, "timestamp": "02:36:19", "text": "部屋、この部屋、私の部屋、この"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9383.349, "timestamp": "02:36:23", "text": "一つは部屋、もう一つは別の部屋。これで３つ目だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9385.15, "timestamp": "02:36:25", "text": "ここはリビングルームです。 4つ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9387.71, "timestamp": "02:36:27", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9392.83, "timestamp": "02:36:32", "text": "5と6。それで私たちは6部屋を"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9397.19, "timestamp": "02:36:37", "text": "最後の駐車解除ストリーム。こんにちは。それでは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9411.27, "timestamp": "02:36:51", "text": "2015年。この部屋は既に清潔に見える。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9417.27, "timestamp": "02:36:57", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9419.63, "timestamp": "02:36:59", "text": "すでに"}]